@startuml debug_seams
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
' debug_seams — v28.10: every seam, one keyboard chord.
' The field report's closing finding: the v28 services were BUILT full of
' injection seams and not one was reachable from the running app. Seams
' only tests can reach are half a seam; this panel is the other half.
' The panel is pure glass — every arrow below lands on a method the test
' suite already calls, or an env var the test suite already flips.
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!include _style.puml

title Ctrl+Shift+D — the DebugPanel and the seams it presses

rectangle "DebugPanel  (glass: presses, never decides)" as panel {
  rectangle "Pretend it is\nthis moment /\nBack to real time" as clock
  rectangle "Sweep now\nForget manners" as affbtn
  rectangle "Sweep now\nOffer now (skip gate)\nClear today's ask" as chkbtn
  rectangle "Show the briefing" as briefbtn
  rectangle "All providers down\nthis run  [checkbox]" as aibtn
}

rectangle "MainWindow\n(composition root)" as mw
rectangle "AffordabilityService" as aff
rectangle "CheckInService" as chk
rectangle "ChatPage::currentBriefing()\nthe exact text the model receives" as brief
rectangle "TICKTIMER_AI_DOWN=*\nprocess env, nothing persists" as env
rectangle "NudgeClient · quick-add ·\nchat route walk\n(every wire checks forcedDown)" as wires

clock --> mw : applyClock(moment | real)
mw --> aff : setNowProvider
mw --> chk : setNowProvider
mw --> brief : nowProvider

affbtn --> aff : sweep()\nforgetManners()
chkbtn --> chk : sweep()\nforceOffer()\nclearTodaysAsk()
briefbtn --> brief : fetched fresh\nper press
aibtn --> env : qputenv / qunsetenv
env --> wires : forcedDown(id)\n→ the C++ voices speak

note bottom of chk
  forceOffer(): the gate skipped ON PURPOSE,
  the ledger untouched ON PURPOSE — a rehearsal
  must not spend the morning's one real ask.
end note

@enduml
